---

Bundled third-party components:

- `extension/vendor/fzstd.js` -- Zstandard decoder by Arjun Barrett, MIT
  licence (see `extension/vendor/fzstd-LICENSE.txt`).

- `extension/vendor/zstddec.js` -- the reference Zstandard decoder compiled to
  WebAssembly and embedded as base64 inside the file. JavaScript wrapper by
  Don McCurdy, MIT licence; Zstandard by Yann Collet / Facebook, BSD 3-Clause
  licence. Both full texts sit at the end of that file, with a summary in
  `extension/vendor/zstddec-LICENSE.txt`.

This project bundles NO code from wplace.live or from the public archive it
reads, and is affiliated with neither. It only reads their public tiles. The format of
those tiles was reverse-engineered from the files themselves; the decoder
(`extension/decoder.js`) is an independent implementation.
